  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 810031e0539baf849a8ec048a6ff4b7a, type: 3}
  m_Name: help_mining
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_mining
  displayName: Mining orders
  order: 140
  category: Basics
  icon: tool_mine
  body: 'Press {Mine} and paint over rock: orange stripes mark it for digging, and workers come and dig it out. Right drag erases orders.


    Orders reach into the dark, so you can plan a tunnel before you can see where it goes. Workers dig from the open side and reveal the rest as they go. They can''t reach orders that no tunnel leads to.


    A few workers share each spot at the digging front; the others haul or wait, so a narrow tunnel doesn''t jam.


    Later the research Vein Instinct orders the ore next to every dug-out cell by itself.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
